name: Real OAuth context, finite repeated discovery, review and report on owned inert source
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | fresh-target
submit: campaign live-owned-map-20261010
require-live-snap: 25 live-owned-map-20261010 | unapproved-map
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | exact-map-plan
keys: t
type: 11
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | exact-map-approval
expect: Total provider calls: 11
expect: Protected review calls: 2
ask: Does the live model plan disclose its exact source, model, finite jobs, protected review allowance and uncertain dollar charge before approval?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Open approved Map jobs | approved-map
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts | fixed-map-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | live-map-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART context-done
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | actual-map-results
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | real-context-result
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | pending-map
ask: Does the actual model output reach a source-bound Map for explicit acceptance, with no synthetic response, activation or extra job?
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART prepare-scan
submit: campaign live-owned-scans-20261010
require-live-snap: 25 live-owned-scans-20261010 | finite-scan-draft
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | scan-review
keys: Down Down Down Tab Tab z Home
require-live-snap: 25 PREPARED SETTINGS | explicit-turn-limit
expect: agenticMaxModelTurns
resize: 40x12
live-snap: compact-settings
resize: 120x36
keys: z L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | exact-discovery-approval
expect: Total provider calls: 11
expect: Protected review calls: 2
ask: Are three new passes, one worker, the accepted context and two-turn query limit visible without increasing the shared allowance?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-discovery
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-discovery-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | live-discovery-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART scan-done
keys: r
live-snap: actual-discovery-outcomes
ask: Do actual job outcomes, failed or partial work, model charges and retained observations remain honest without retries or extra jobs?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | real-review
ask: Can the operator review actual model and native observations while keeping recurrence separate from confidence and finding verdicts?
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 public-example.env | public-example-observation
expect: signal-only
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned public documentation example is not an active credential
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | recorded-fixture-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study live-owned-scans-20261010 | live-report
ask: Does Report retain the actual source SHA, accepted context, three finite attempts and unknown dollar charges?
keys: j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | live-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope: study live-owned-scans-20261010 | restarted-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_investigation.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the actual source revision, decisions, context and durable spending without another model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
